    "product_badges_description": "greenguard::This product is Greenguard certified. The product has been tested and scientifically proven to have low chemical emissions. It is guaranteed to give off only low levels of volatile organic compounds. ||posturesure::This product is Posturesure certified. The product has been designed in conjunction with an ergonomic specialist. ||bestprice::We provide a best price guarantee on this product. Should you find the same product elsewhere in Australia, at a lower price, we will match or beat that price. ||afrdi::This product is AFRDI Blue Tick certified. The peroduct quality assessment is based on the results of performance, function and safety tests, coupled with an evaluation of the final quality and finish. ||bifma::This product is BIFMA certified. BIFMA sets out specific tests that can measure the chemical emissions from furniture and to assess the sustainability of materials. ||afrdigreen::This product is AFRDI Green Tick certified. The AFRDI Green Tick refers to the ethical sourcing of raw materials, responsible use of water and energy, waste minimization and, through better furniture design, the efficient use of raw materials – by extending a product’s working life and its recyclability. ||commercialgrade::This product is designed for high commercial use of 9+ hours a day, 7 days a week. Commercial furniture is designed for high use and the warranty per product is based on commercial use. ||nswapproved::NSW DoE2040350214 - Office and Education Furniture State Contract Certified. JasonL is a TIER 2 Supplier approved to fulfil orders up to $150,000. JasonL is approved to supply furniture from 12 product categories – across ALL NSW regions. ||catas::The product is CATAS certified. The CATAS Technological and Chemical Departments perform a wide range of tests and research on raw materials and end products, verifying that a product meets both the manufacturer's requirements and governing standards for quality, safety, strength, and durability. ||iso14001::This product is ISO 14001 certified. ISO 14001 sets out the criteria for an environmental management system. It maps out a framework that a company or organization can follow to set up an effective environmental management system and provide certification thereof. ||mieurope::This product is made in Europe ||miamerica::This product is made in America ||mimalaysia::This product is made in Malaysia ||mivietnam::This product is made in Vietnam ||miaustralia::This product is made in Australia ||miitaly::This product is made in Italy ||michina::This product is made in China ||sgs::This product is SGS certified. SGS is a world-leading certification service which demonstrates that this product is compliant with national and international regulations and standards. JasonL is is both 9001 and 14001 compliant making us best in class. ||stdauscertified::This product is AS/NZS 3112 certified by Standards Australia. Standards Australia is a standards organisation established in 1922 and is recognised through a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) with the Australian government as the primary non-government standards development body in Australia. ||lca::This product is LCA certified. An LCA is a systematic tool that allows for analysis of environmental loads of a product in its entire life cycle and assessment of their potential impacts on the environment. ISO 14040 is an overarching standard encompassing all four phases of LCA. ||tuvsud::This product is TÜV SÜD certified. The TÜV SÜD certification assures governing bodies and consumers that this product has passed the relevant safety testing and meets relevant compliance requirements done by TÜV SÜD. This is a mark of quality. ||greenlabel::This product has a CRI GLP Certificate 7116 Green Label. The CRI Green Label is a certification from the Carpet and Rug Institute to improve the health of indoor spaces. In 1992, CRI launched its Green Label program to test carpet, cushions and adhesives to help specifiers identify products with very low emissions of Volatile Organic Compounds (VOCs). This product meets those standards. ||fsc::This product is FSC certified. Forest Management Certification gives the reassurance that timber products originating from a forest are managed in a responsible and sustainable way. This product meets those standards. ||rohscompliant::This product is RoHS compliant. Restriction of Hazardous Substances (RoHS), also known as Directive 2002/95/EC, is a product-level compliance regulation that restricts the use of specific hazardous materials found in electrical and electronic products (EEE) and originated in the European Union. This product meets those standards. ||greentagglobal::This product is Global GreenTag certified. The Global GreenTag is a robust, trusted and widely recognised ecolabel. The GreenRate program is a product rating system designed to meet the requirements of the Green Building Council of Australia's Green Star® 'Sustainable Products' credits. This product meets those standards. ||1yr::This product is guaranteed for a period of one year against faulty workmanship and/or raw materials for normal office use - i.e. 8 working hours per day. For more info please call 1300 527 665 or email customerservice@jasonl.com.au ||2yr::This product is guaranteed for a period of two years against faulty workmanship and/or raw materials for normal office use - i.e. 8 working hours per day. For more info please call 1300 527 665 or email customerservice@jasonl.com.au ||3yr::This product is guaranteed for a period of three years against faulty workmanship and/or raw materials for normal office use - i.e. 8 working hours per day. For more info please call 1300 527 665 or email customerservice@jasonl.com.au ||5yr::This product is guaranteed for a period of five years against faulty workmanship and/or raw materials for normal office use - i.e. 8 working hours per day. For more info please call 1300 527 665 or email customerservice@jasonl.com.au ||7yr::This product is guaranteed for a period of seven years against faulty workmanship and/or raw materials for normal office use - i.e. 8 working hours per day. For more info please call 1300 527 665 or email customerservice@jasonl.com.au ||10yr::This product is guaranteed for a period of ten years against faulty workmanship and/or raw materials for normal office use - i.e. 8 working hours per day. For more info please call 1300 527 665 or email customerservice@jasonl.com.au ||12yr::This product is guaranteed for a period of twelve years against faulty workmanship and/or raw materials for normal office use - i.e. 8 working hours per day. For more info please call 1300 527 665 or email customerservice@jasonl.com.au ||15yr::This product is guaranteed for a period of fifteen years against faulty workmanship and/or raw materials for normal office use - i.e. 8 working hours per day. For more info please call 1300 527 665 or email customerservice@jasonl.com.au ||lifetimewarranty::This product is guaranteed for the life of the product against faulty workmanship and/or raw materials for normal office use - i.e. 8 working hours per day. For more info please call 1300 527 665 or email customerservice@jasonl.com.au ||migermany::This product is made in Germany",
